{
  "_note": "H5 页改完整份列表后原样落盘(AF 没有数组增删原语,增删在页面 JS 里做)。\n`drop` 非空时顺手删掉被移除城市的缓存键(两套标准各一个,键拼法与 aq.df 一致)。\n最后刷新「我的城市」两个组件 —— 它们跟随这份列表,不刷就要等半小时。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "action": "data.set",
      "params": {
        "key": "cities",
        "value": "${list}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dLat",
        "value": "${dropLat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dLon",
        "value": "${dropLon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${dLat}),0),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "data.remove",
          "params": {
            "key": "$[connect::(c.aq.,cn,.,${dLat},_,${dLon})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "data.remove",
          "params": {
            "key": "$[connect::(c.aq.,us,.,${dLat},_,${dLon})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "v2 的旧键(不含标准)顺手清掉。",
          "action": "data.remove",
          "params": {
            "key": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${dLat},_,${dLon})]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "action": "widget.refresh",
      "params": {
        "scope": "widget",
        "widgetId": "cities"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "widget.refresh",
      "params": {
        "scope": "widget",
        "widgetId": "cities6"
      }
    }
  ]
}
